  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_first_00",
      "hash64": "DD627A8DBA6EFA8F",
      "text": "嘿呀！请指教！！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_first_01",
      "hash64": "DD62798DBA6EF8DC",
      "text": "我是热血沸腾的凰檗！\\n让我们一起燃烧斗志吧！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_00",
      "hash64": "34032E597B9C9561",
      "text": "嘿呀！转学生！\\n是你叫我来的，对吧？[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "34032D597B9C93AE",
      "text": "能够在新的职场进行挑战，\\n我对此兴奋不已啊！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "34032C597B9C91FB",
      "text": "我会被叫到这里来，\\n应该是有什么理由吧！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "34032B597B9C9048",
      "text": "你希望从我这里\\n得到什么呢！？[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "1C6E62F201B3B63D",
      "text": "热血精神",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "1C6E5FF201B3B124",
      "text": "知识",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_select_03",
      "hash64": "1C6E60F201B3B2D7",
      "text": "只要你人在就好",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "340332597B9C9C2D",
      "text": "哦哦！那是我擅长的领域！\\c\\n就用我的热血精神来让蓝莓学园\\n燃烧起热烈的氛围吧！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_04b",
      "hash64": "FE0ADD0D0B1D9A3D",
      "text": "哦哦！原来你对我的\\n对战学知识抱有期待啊！\\c\\n这里不愧是注重宝可梦对战的学园！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_04c",
      "hash64": "FE0ADC0D0B1D988A",
      "text": "那是什么理由啊！\\n你怎么了，转学生！？\\r\\n你果然还是在讴歌青春吗！？[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "340331597B9C9A7A",
      "text": "不论如何，\\n都包在热血沸腾的凰檗我身上吧！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_06",
      "hash64": "340330597B9C98C7",
      "text": "就当是挂在铁掌力士的肩膀上，\\n你尽管放心吧！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "8D37EC72C2EDB86E",
      "text": "转学生！\\n生态巨蛋真棒啊！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "8D37ED72C2EDBA21",
      "text": "我发现，\\n巨蛋就相当于是学院的操场！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "8D37EA72C2EDB508",
      "text": "这里非常宽阔，\\n特别适合用来跑步练习呢！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "8D37EB72C2EDB6BB",
      "text": "我正考虑下堂课\\n用实践的形式绕巨蛋跑一圈呢。\\r\\n你觉得如何啊？[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "37A1D076C23731E0",
      "text": "不错啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "37A1D376C23736F9",
      "text": "那样的话有点……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "8D37F072C2EDBF3A",
      "text": "嗯！腰腿能得到锻炼，\\n肯定是百利而无一害的！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp02_04b",
      "hash64": "E3CCEB0139FC2288",
      "text": "你觉得还是太过头了吗？\\n好像就只有我想跑一样！\\c\\n真没办法……那就改为跑半圈吧！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "8D37F172C2EDC0ED",
      "text": "当然，\\n我会让你也一起来体验的！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "36D2226B2783F7FF",
      "text": "这个学园的学生\\n真是充满了干劲啊！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "36D2216B2783F64C",
      "text": "来上对战学课程的学生，\\n注意力真是不同凡响！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "36D2246B2783FB65",
      "text": "听说在这个学园，\\n越是和战斗有关的课程，\\r\\n成绩的占比就越高！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "36D2236B2783F9B2",
      "text": "只要擅长宝可梦对战，就有希望\\n当联盟职员，加入巡护员部队，\\r\\n或是成为专业的训练家哦！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "C4EEFAC9B85C331B",
      "text": "超多的梦想！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "C4EEFBC9B85C34CE",
      "text": "真的吗！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "36D21E6B2783F133",
      "text": "当然，你的目标也可以是成为\\n像我一样的对战学老师哦！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp03_04b",
      "hash64": "AAFB011425330CA3",
      "text": "唔唔！你是第一次听说吗！？\\c\\n你不知情，居然还能当上冠军，\\n可见你是打心眼里喜欢宝可梦啊！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "36D21D6B2783EF80",
      "text": "不管是对战学，还是任何事物，\\n只要努力学习，\\r\\n就能拥有无限的选择！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp03_06",
      "hash64": "36D2206B2783F499",
      "text": "为了将来不后悔，\\n你要好好学习啊，转学生！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "6BAD646D5CC72559",
      "text": "……我好像有点\\n在对你说教的感觉啊！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "6BAD636D5CC723A6",
      "text": "不论是作为老师还是战友，\\n我都会很关注你哦。[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_trade_01_02",
      "hash64": "6BAD626D5CC721F3",
      "text": "为了促进我们的感情，\\n来交换宝可梦吧！？[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_trade_01_03",
      "hash64": "6BAD616D5CC72040",
      "text": "好！那我们开始吧！\\n我打算选玛沙那！\\r\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，你要选哪个孩子呢？[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_trade_01_04",
      "hash64": "6BAD686D5CC72C25",
      "text": "你选[VAR 0x0101(0001)]啊！\\n我感觉它挺嘿呀的，真棒！\\c\\n我会每天锻炼它，\\n让它强到逆天！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_trade_02_00",
      "hash64": "C4E22286A4184866",
      "text": "那么转学生你的[VAR 0x0101(0001)]\\n就和我的玛沙那来交换咯！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
