          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_trade_02_01",
      "hash64": "C4E22386A4184A19",
      "text": "无法使用初训家不是自己的\\n宝可梦进行交换。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_trade_02_02",
      "hash64": "C4E22086A4184500",
      "text": "无法使用稀有宝可梦\\n进行交换。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_trade_02_03",
      "hash64": "C4E22186A41846B3",
      "text": "无法使用异色宝可梦\\n进行交换。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_trade_03_00",
      "hash64": "EFCD387B5B0C8FF7",
      "text": "同行宝可梦只有１只的话，\\n是不能交换的！\\c\\n等你同行宝可梦有２只以上之后，\\n再来找我嘿呀吧！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_trade_03_01",
      "hash64": "EFCD377B5B0C8E44",
      "text": "现在先不用交换吗？\\n等你想嘿呀时再来和我说吧！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_trade_04_00",
      "hash64": "BE282651A1D37EAC",
      "text": "嘿呀！转学生！\\c\\n你愿意开始和我\\n交换宝可梦了吗！？[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_talkto_00",
      "hash64": "A7FFB84DE8792F60",
      "text": "嘿呀！转学生！\\n你要邀请我打宝可梦对战吗！？[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_cancel_00",
      "hash64": "E0FDDD4AB438E6AB",
      "text": "唔唔！原来不是啊……\\n要对战的话，我随时奉陪！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_battlestart_00",
      "hash64": "0DD5FB9ED4EA4FC3",
      "text": "我没有任何理由拒绝！\\n我们跑去对战场吧！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
