    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_battleend_win_00_00",
      "hash64": "CFF3B6E9B6AE8208",
      "text": "不甘心啊……！\\n我又被彻底打败了！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_battleend_win_00_01",
      "hash64": "CFF3B7E9B6AE83BB",
      "text": "但是我的收获也很大！\\n我会吸取经验，下次一定要赢你！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_battleend_win_00_02",
      "hash64": "CFF3B8E9B6AE856E",
      "text": "多谢转学生你的关照！\\n收下我的心意吧！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_battleend_win_00_03",
      "hash64": "CFF3B9E9B6AE8721",
      "text": "一口气喝掉攻击增强剂后，\\n让我们朝着夕阳嘿呀吧！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_reward_00",
      "hash64": "5AE397A063E469DC",
      "text": "[EMPTY 62]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
